# Workspace Protection Rules

## Allowed

Only modify files inside the current project workspace.

Example:

D:\Laragon\www\my-project\

---

## Forbidden

Never modify any files outside the current workspace.

Never edit:

- D:\Laragon\
- D:\Laragon\bin\
- D:\Laragon\etc\
- D:\Laragon\usr\
- C:\Windows\
- C:\Program Files\
- C:\Program Files (x86)\
- C:\Users\<username>\AppData\

Never modify:

- php.ini
- httpd.conf
- nginx.conf
- hosts
- Laragon configuration
- Windows Registry
- Git configuration

---

## Confirmation Required

Before modifying anything outside the workspace:

1. Stop.
2. Explain why it is required.
3. Ask for user confirmation.
4. Do not continue until confirmation is received.

---

## Safety

Never delete files outside the workspace.

Never rename files outside the workspace.

Never install software globally.

Never change system PATH.

Never change Windows settings.

Never restart Apache, MySQL or Laragon without permission.

Never create files outside the workspace.